WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
A figure stands in warm, glowing light. Source marks appear along the top.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
Earth’s curved horizon glows at sunrise. The visible message links the future to a starting idea.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
A busy city street glows in sunlight. Text links growing ideas with innovation.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
A figure stands in warm light. Text asks whether innovation can change more than our lives.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
A person reaches toward a glowing digital interface. Text questions whether moving through the world can avoid harm.

00:23.000 --> 00:33.000
Futuristic buildings and greenery share a city. Visible questions link technology and progress with protecting nature.

00:33.000 --> 00:39.000
Wind turbines stand on hills above futuristic buildings and transport. The text imagines cities supporting life.

00:39.000 --> 00:44.000
A green city street combines futuristic vehicles with vegetation. Text introduces technology and nature together.

00:44.000 --> 00:48.851
People walk along a luminous path beneath trees. The closing message imagines technology and nature growing together.
